        "predicate": "summary",
        "object": "<p>The queen of country was interred next to her late husband in an intimate ceremony attended by close family</p><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/music/dolly-parton\">Dolly Parton</a> was laid to rest in a private ceremony in Nashville on Friday, her family has confirmed.</p><p>The queen of country music, who <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/aug/25/dolly-parton-country-singer-dead\">died aged 80 on 25 August</a> “after bravely facing a brief battle with cancer”, was interred at Woodlawn Memorial Park and Mausoleum alongside her husband of 60 years, Carl Thomas.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/aug/31/dolly-parton-funeral\">Continue reading...</a>"
